HOW TO APPLY THIS PATCH
========================

Option A — Manual (recommended for understanding):
  1. git clone https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V2.git
  2. cd DeepSeek-V2
  3. git checkout -b feature/log-analysis-window-attention
  4. cp /path/to/loglens-ai-demo/log_attention.py .
  5. Edit modeling_deepseek.py using the diff above (search for the
     DeepseekAttention class and apply the + lines)
  6. Add to config.json: { "log_analysis_mode": true, "log_window_size": 512 }
  7. Test: python test_modeling.py

Option B — Git apply:
  git apply deepseek_log_window.patch

What the patch does:
  - If config.log_analysis_mode == True  → uses LogWindowAttention (our module)
  - If config.log_analysis_mode == False → uses original full attention (unchanged)
  - Zero breaking changes to the base model
  - Fully backward compatible
